import{_ as n,o as a,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 489 | Dragon Rune · \\"All Beings Between Heaven and Earth Can Become Dragons\\" Critique: The Gift System of Being-Made-Dragons","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 489 | Dragon Rune · \\"All Beings Between Heaven and Earth Can Become Dragons\\" Critique: The Gift System of Being-Made-Dragons","no":489,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Rune","Gu Chensha","All-Can-Become-Dragons","Gift System","Being-Made-Dragons"],"related":["05-Myriad-Ranks Joint-Advancement Basic Program","08-Road-for-Everyone Guarantee System","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.md","filePath":"en/0489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.md"}'),i={name:"en/0489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,u,h){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-489-dragon-rune-·-all-beings-between-heaven-and-earth-can-become-dragons-critique-the-gift-system-of-being-made-dragons" tabindex="-1">Entry 489 | Dragon Rune · &quot;All Beings Between Heaven and Earth Can Become Dragons&quot; Critique: The Gift System of Being-Made-Dragons <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-489-dragon-rune-·-all-beings-between-heaven-and-earth-can-become-dragons-critique-the-gift-system-of-being-made-dragons" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 489 | Dragon Rune · &quot;All Beings Between Heaven and Earth Can Become Dragons&quot; Critique: The Gift System of Being-Made-Dragons&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Rune Decomposition (Entry 5) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 08, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-everyone-can-become-a-dragon-vs-everyone-is-made-into-a-dragon" tabindex="-1">Introduction: &quot;everyone can become a dragon&quot; vs. &quot;everyone is made into a dragon&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-everyone-can-become-a-dragon-vs-everyone-is-made-into-a-dragon" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: &quot;everyone can become a dragon&quot; vs. &quot;everyone is made into a dragon&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — on Gu Chensha&#39;s grand proposition &quot;all beings between heaven and earth can become dragons,&quot; must make a one-character distinction: <strong>is it &quot;all can become dragons,&quot; or &quot;all are made into dragons&quot;?</strong> One character&#39;s difference, world apart. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;All beings can become dragons&quot; sounds universal-benefit, but look closely at implementation: Myriad Ranks &quot;can become dragons&quot; because Gu Chensha opened this road. The road he opened, the door he set, the standard he set, the speed he controlled. <strong>He is not returning the road to Myriad Ranks; he built a road in his own courtyard, then invited Myriad Ranks in to walk it.</strong> Any flagstone loose on this road, he can take it back anytime.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gift-system &quot;all can become dragons&quot; has three structural problems:</p><ol><li><strong>Withdrawable</strong>: today he lets you become; tomorrow he can stop you becoming.</li><li><strong>Dependency</strong>: Myriad Ranks&#39; dragon-becoming qualification granted by him; between Myriad Ranks and him is &quot;benefactor — benefitted&quot; relationship.</li><li><strong>Single standard</strong>: only &quot;Gu-Chensha-type dragon&quot; one success model; Myriad Ranks&#39; diversity flattened.</li></ol><p>Three stacked: even if Myriad Ranks all become dragons, they are <strong>being-made-dragons</strong> — the dragon identity, the dragon road, the dragon shape, all set by him.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can become dragons&quot; essentially turns &quot;evolution qualification&quot; — something Myriad Ranks should inherently own — into a prize he can distribute. <strong>True universal benefit is not &quot;I allow you to become,&quot; but &quot;you inherently have qualification to become; I only break the monopoly.&quot;</strong> Gu Chensha stands at the monopolist&#39;s position distributing qualification; he himself is the last link of monopoly.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Gu Chensha-Type &quot;All Can Become Dragons&quot;</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou-Type &quot;Myriad-Ranks Republicanism&quot;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>He allows, Myriad Ranks can become</td><td>Myriad Ranks inherently qualified; break monopoly</td></tr><tr><td>He sets standard</td><td>Anchor Council collective legislation</td></tr><tr><td>Road withdrawable</td><td>Road is public infrastructure, not withdrawable</td></tr><tr><td>Single model</td><td>Five Myriad-Ranks genealogies; each walks own road</td></tr><tr><td>Benefactor and benefitted</td><td>Co-builder and co-builder</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain control: Path A = Gu Chensha distributes &quot;dragon-becoming qualification&quot;; Path B = Anchor Symbiosis breaks monopoly. Path A after a thousand years, Myriad Ranks&#39; dragon-becomers number in tens of thousands, but all become dragons by Gu Chensha&#39;s standard; civilizational form single; Path B after a thousand years, Myriad Ranks&#39; dragon-becomers myriad forms; civilizational form rich. <strong>&quot;Being-made-dragon&quot; raises ten thousand miniature Gu Chenshas; &quot;self-becoming-dragon&quot; raises ten thousand new civilizations.</strong></p><p>This control also reveals &quot;all can become dragons&quot; narrative&#39;s hidden trap: it sounds universal-benefit, but actually defines &quot;dragon&quot; as the only success standard. In Gu Chensha&#39;s framework, Myriad Ranks have only one road — become dragon. But Myriad Ranks&#39; diversity means: some races may not need to become dragons; they need to become themselves; some civilizations may not need &quot;dragon&quot; form; they need their own civilizational path. Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can become dragons&quot; essentially flattens Myriad Ranks into the same shape. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Ranks republicanism allows Myriad Ranks ten thousand shapes — this is true full coverage.</p><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can become dragons&quot; and Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Myriad-Ranks republicanism&quot; look similar, actually fundamentally different. Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can&quot; is &quot;I allow you to become&quot; — qualification granted by him; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;republicanism&quot; is &quot;you inherently have qualification to become&quot; — qualification needs no one&#39;s grant. This difference is the fundamental difference between gift system and republican system. <strong>Under gift system, Myriad Ranks are &quot;the selected&quot;; under republican system, Myriad Ranks are &quot;the owners.&quot;</strong> The selected&#39;s qualification can be taken back; the owners&#39; qualification cannot be taken back. Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can become dragons&quot; no matter how grand, is still gift system — because its premise is &quot;I allow.&quot;</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Ranks republicanism, and Gu Chensha&#39;s &quot;all can become dragons,&quot; look similar, actually opposite. Gu Chensha&#39;s logic is &quot;I am strong, so I allow you to be strong too&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s logic is &quot;you inherently should be strong, only blocked by monopoly.&quot; The former is top-down gift; the latter is bottom-up liberation. <strong>Under gift system, Myriad Ranks&#39; strength is given by others; under republican system, Myriad Ranks&#39; strength grows on their own.</strong> Given can be taken back; grown cannot be taken away. This is the fundamental divide.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;All can become dragons&quot; implementation depends on Gu Chensha personally; unsustainable</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely high</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Myriad Ranks&#39; diversity flattened into single model</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: evolution qualification taken as prize</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least let students practice themselves; Gu Chensha treats &quot;qualification&quot; itself as gift</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks nominally full coverage; actually shape prescribed</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: single dragon shape; farthest from multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;All can become dragons&quot; four words, Gu Chensha said as blessing; Heng Yuan Zhou wants to read as question: <strong>who allowed it? Who set it? Who can take it back?</strong> True Myriad-Ranks republicanism needs no one to &quot;allow&quot; Myriad Ranks to become dragons — Myriad Ranks inherently should become dragons, only historically blocked by monopolists. Breaking monopoly is not gift, it is return.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Rune · &quot;all beings between heaven and earth can become dragons&quot; critique · the gift system of being-made-dragons described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.html">Entry 485 · Overview</a> · <a href="./488_模块2-龙符-古尘沙掠夺思维拆解-替众生承罪的恩赐本质.html">Entry 488 · Gu Chensha&#39;s Predatory Thinking</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad-Ranks Joint-Advancement Basic Program</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=n(i,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
